R_CleanTempDir(): always R_unlink(), no rm through the shell

At exit R removed its session temp directory with `rm -Rf` through
R_system(), so every exit started /bin/sh and rm. R_unlink() is already
the fallback for paths with shell-special characters, and what Windows
uses. feat-no-host-paths PLAN.md, phase A2.

